---
import Page from '@layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Harmony Immigration Services collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <section class="pt-16 pb-24 md:pt-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="eyebrow justify-center">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="mt-5">Privacy Policy &amp; Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg">
          This page explains how we handle your information and the terms that apply when you use our website and services.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal prose-content mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl">
        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          Harmony Immigration Services ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This policy outlines what information we collect when you use this website or contact us, why we collect it, and how we keep it safe.
        </p>

        <h3>Information we collect</h3>
        <p>
          When you submit an enquiry or booking form, we collect the details you provide — such as your name, email address, phone number, and a summary of your situation — so we can respond to your enquiry.
        </p>

        <h3>How we use your information</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to enquiries and provide the immigration advice or services you request.</li>
          <li>To communicate with you about your case, appointments, or documentation.</li>
          <li>To meet our legal and professional obligations as a licensed immigration adviser.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>How we protect your information</h3>
        <p>
          We take reasonable steps to keep your personal information secure and only share it with third parties where necessary to progress your case (for example, with relevant immigration authorities) or where required by law.
        </p>

        <h3>Your rights</h3>
        <p>
          You may ask to see, correct, or request deletion of the personal information we hold about you at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:info@harmony-immigration.com">info@harmony-immigration.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
        <p>
          By using this website or engaging our services, you agree to the following terms.
        </p>

        <h3>Advice and services</h3>
        <p>
          Any general information provided on this website is for guidance only and does not constitute formal immigration advice. Formal advice is only given once we have reviewed your specific circumstances as part of a paid engagement.
        </p>

        <h3>No guaranteed outcomes</h3>
        <p>
          While we work diligently on every case, immigration decisions are made by the relevant government authorities. We cannot guarantee the outcome of any application.
        </p>

        <h3>Website content</h3>
        <p>
          This website and its content are provided "as is". We make reasonable efforts to keep information accurate and up to date but do not warrant that all content is complete or error-free.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-neutral-400)]">
          Last updated: 2026. If you have any questions about this policy, please <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
